msgid ""
"8-bit-per-channel unsigned floating-point green/blue/red channel data format "
"with normalized value. Values are in the [code][0.0, 1.0][/code] range. Blue "
"and red channel data is stored at halved horizontal resolution (i.e. 2 "
"horizontally adjacent pixels will share the same value for the blue/red "
"channel)."
msgstr ""
"Format de dades de canal verd/blau/vermell de coma flotant sense signar de 8 "
"bits per canal amb valor normalitzat. Els valors es troben a l'interval [code]"
"[0.0, 1.0][/code]. Les dades del canal blau i vermell s'emmagatzemen amb una "
"resolució horitzontal reduïda a la meitat (és a dir, 2 píxels adjacents "
"horitzontalment compartiran el mateix valor per al canal blau/vermell)."

msgid ""
"8-bit-per-channel unsigned floating-point blue/green/red channel data format "
"with normalized value. Values are in the [code][0.0, 1.0][/code] range. Blue "
"and red channel data is stored at halved horizontal resolution (i.e. 2 "
"horizontally adjacent pixels will share the same value for the blue/red "
